// Test: Compound assignment (+=)
// Spec: 02-SYNTAX.md § 2.3 Compound Assignment
// Priority: P0 - Bootstrap Critical
//
// Purpose:
// Validate compound assignment operators work.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print 52 (42 += 10)

rite main() {
    ≔ vary x: !i32 = 42;
    x += 10;
    println(x);
}
